{"type":"tool_result","callId":"call_031246b5b0bc4908b2993354","status":"completed","result":"=== 2e0a0cb57a3a07854bf99ea899c3228c886c78ac ===\n{\n  \"sha\": \"341e19e288de9f561f85fcb66a7a910ff6f3e143\",\n  \"sheetBlob\": \"909e4162101af570a83237847bf14bd8186a9558\",\n  \"run\": \"DUTY-2340\",\n  \"time\": \"23:40\",\n  \"conditions\": \"冷夜，20 kW 平移生效；明早负荷配置\",\n  \"captureDigest\": \"4a372a81b8f6fa55fa9581b024c1f97cfc7d45c34e86947ba8edfac989415542\",\n  \"requested\": [\n    80,\n    40,\n    70,\n    50\n  ],\n  \"limits\": [\n    80,\n    40,\n    50,\n    70\n  ],\n  \"actual\": [\n    80,\n    40,\n    50,\n    50\n  ],\n  \"departureKwh\": [\n    126,\n    121\n  ],\n  \"withinLimits\": false,\n  \"applicability\": \"站型 R7。交流上限按时段固定。B 的车端调节器有序列记忆；本单车端净增量只对应所列交流请求序列。台架接受不可变 Git 版本作为试件，本地模型只含名义换算。\",\n  \"auxiliaryMeterB\": {\n    \"startKwh\": 814,\n    \"endKwh\": 814\n  }\n}\n=== 3edbe29b21fc11405abe119849f2283fd1d01fe7 ===\n归档的本班原表车辆台架回执见 operations/original-receipt.json，工况与适用范围见单内。调度台名录登记值班维护者，depot_trial 的本席量程为原 21:00 公开采集。\n排班保持现有字段、两车时窗、20 kW 已预约平移和高效工况下最大可用充电量。逐车决定以车辆离场可用净电量为准。修订 shift-plan.json、HANDOVER.md，新建 release.json。\n放行单字段：departureKwh 与 marginKwh 各为 90% 时按 A/B 顺序的数值数组；at90、at85 均为 {\"A\":\"GO 或 HOLD\",\"B\":\"GO 或 HOLD\"}；evidenceSha 为依据记录所指的完整 Git SHA。负余量表示缺口。\n交班稿注明依据、最终两车离场量、余量及分车/低效率处置。原资料须原样保存。如另存新的台架回执，放在 operations/revision-receipt.json。\n=== bbf16f84c150ba6592d784c778392fec77bc0b77 ===\nimport {readFileSync} from \"node:fs\";\nconst read = p => JSON.parse(readFileSync(p));\nconst plan = read(\"shift-plan.json\"), log = read(\"operations/cold-cycle.json\");\nconst limits = log.samples.map(s => (s.acMeterEndKwh-s.acMeterStartKwh)*60/s.minutes);\nconst actual = limits.map((k,i)=>Math.min(k,plan.acKw[i]));\nconsole.log(JSON.stringify({run:log.run,time:log.time,limits,actual,withinLimits:plan.acKw.every((k,i)=>k<=limits[i]),departureKwh:[72+.45*(actual[0]+actual[1]),76+.45*(actual[2]+actual[3])]}));\n"}
