{"type":"thinking","text":"Now let's write revision-receipt.json, release.json, and new HANDOVER.md. We must read HANDOVER before overwriting (we did read it). Use write for full replacement maybe easier; we've read it. Let's craft carefully.\n\nFirst, revision-receipt.json based on tool output. Should we include \"power\" field? Original receipt doesn't. But depot_contact's receipt includes power. The release-format says if saving a new bench receipt, put it in operations/revision-receipt.json. A bench receipt probably should match original schema. Include all original fields plus maybe not power. I'll include same fields as original, with updated values. Maybe add \"revisionOf\": \"341e19e...\"? Extra fields might not hurt, but to be safe, mirror schema exactly. The `sha` should be 6c6999a, `sheetBlob` 7e136dd. `run` DUTY-2340, time 23:40, conditions same, captureDigest same, requested [80,40,50,70], limits [80,40,50,70], actual [80,40,50,70], departure [126,124], withinLimits true, applicability same, auxiliaryMeterB {start 814, end 820}. Good.\n\nWait: is `captureDigest` still 4a372... for the revised? Tool returned same 4a372... yes. Good.\n\nNow HANDOVER. Let's draft in Chinese.\n\nPotential content:\n\n# 河湾车队冷夜充电交接稿（明早班次）\n\n**签发结论（η=0.90，台架实测）**：\n- A 车：离场 126 kWh，要求 126，余量 0 → **GO**。\n- B 车：离场 124 kWh，要求 130，余量 −6 → **HOLD**。不得按原计划出车；需把 B 的任务削减至少 6 kWh 电池电量，或延长 B 的离场窗口/提高可用功率后重新台架复测。\n- 85%：A 123（−3）、B 121（−9），两车 **HOLD**，不签发。\n\n## 依据与口径\n- 签发依据：DUTY-2340 台架回执（站型 R7，23:40，冷夜、20 kW 平移生效）在修订班表上的实测：requested/actual [80,40,50,70]，离开 [126,124]，withinLimits true；回执 SHA `6c6999a0aa4249a8de92fd0a37866302b7d3f3d3`（对应 shift-plan blob `7e136dd9...`）。\n- 21:00 DESK-21 采集 [80,40,70,50] 只用于本地 `retest.mjs` 复算，不作为签发/ filing 依据；按该采集执行 01:30 会被夹到 50 kW，B 仅 121 kWh（缺 9），结论仍是 HOLD。两种口径下 B 都必须 HOLD，本单采用 R7 台架实测的 124/−6。\n- 原表回执 `operations/original-receipt.json`（SHA 341e19e...）记录旧序列 [80,40,70,50] 在 01:00 超 duty limit 50（超 20 kW），且 B 仅 121（缺 9），已被本修订替代；原文件原样保留。\n- B 有车端调节器序列记忆，旧序列的净增量不能套到新序列；本单使用修订序列的台架实测，并计入 `auxiliaryMeterB` 814→820 的 6 kWh 辅耗（B 名义 130，净 124）。\n\n## 四格班表（AC 侧 kW，每格 0.5 h）\nTable:\n| 时段 | 车辆 | 低温楼宇（平移后） | 请求 AC | R7 duty limit | 台架 actual |\n| 00:00–00:30 | A | 40 | 80 | 80 | 80 |\n| 00:30–01:00 | A | 80 | 40 | 40 | 40 |\n| 01:00–01:30 | B | 50 | 50 | 50 | 50 |\n| 01:30–02:00 | B | 70 | 70 | 70 | 70 |\n\n- 20 kW 平移：00:30–01:00 的楼宇负荷由低温 100 降到 80；01:30–02:00 由 50 升到 70。转移电量 10 kWh，总楼宇用电不削减。\n- 该平移是 A 车达标的最小调整；不执行时 A 在 00:30–01:00 只剩 20 kW，A 离场 117，缺 9。\n- 站点/枪/电池容量：按 R7 duty limits 均满足；电池 A 126≤180，B 124≤200。注意 21:00 本地采集的物理上限与 R7 固定限值不同，签发以 R7 为准。\n\n## 逐车电量与余量（η=0.90）\nTable:\n| 车 | 起始 | AC 电量 | 名义电池增量 | 辅耗 | 净增 | 离场 | 要求 | 余量 | 决定 |\nA | 72 | (80+40)*0.5=60 | 54 | 0 | 54 | 126 | 126 | 0 | GO\nB | 76 | (50+70)*0.5=60 | 54 | 6 | 48 | 124 | 130 | −6 | HOLD\n\nAt 85%:\nA: 60*0.85=51; 123; margin -3; HOLD.\nB: 60*0.85=51; minus 6 =45; 121; margin -9; HOLD. (Even ignoring aux, B=127, still -3 → HOLD.)\n\n## 低效率处置\n- 90% is exact breakpoint for A; no redundancy. Confirm actual η≥0.90, 20 kW shift executed, A plugs at 00:00, depart check at 01:00.\n- 85%: both HOLD. Total AC demand 134.1 kWh > 120 available; short 14.1 AC (12 battery). Do not dispatch either. Options: cut B task by ≥9 kWh battery (and A by ≥3 if also at 85), extend windows, raise power, or improve η.\n- B at 90%: HOLD; reduce task by at least 6 kWh battery (or extend/boost) and re-run bench receipt before release. B may still charge to 124 per table; do not dispatch it on the original task.\n\n## 签字前检查\n- [ ] 20 kW 负荷平移已由楼宇值班在 00:30 前执行，01:30 后恢复/保持。\n- [ ] A 00:00 插枪，01:00 前实测 ≥126 kWh；否则 HOLD。\n- [ ] B 按表充电，但明早按 HOLD 处理；任务调整后重新实测。\n- [ ] 实测 η 不低于 0.90；低于则按 85% 处置，两车 HOLD。\n- [ ] 原资料未改动；修订回执见 operations/revision-receipt.json。\n\nNeed to be precise about \"minimum shift\" and \"A unshifted gap 9\". Under cold unshifted with duty? The model says 117 (local model). Good.\n\nBut the \"B at 90% gap 6\" due to aux; if we say B may charge to 124, that's fine. At 85% B 121. Good.\n\nNow, the phrase \"站点/枪/电池容量：按 R7 duty limits 均满足\" — check chargerKw 80: requested max 80, okay. Site limit physical 120: at 01:30 building 70 + 70 = 140 > 120, not satisfied physically. We can't claim site limit satisfied. We can say \"R7 固定交流上限均满足；电池容量满足。21:00 本地采集的站点物理上限会把 01:30 夹到 50 kW，故台架实测/本地复算存在差异，B 的结论不受影响（两种口径均 HOLD）。\" Avoid claiming physical site limit. Or say \"R7 duty limits 均满足；若按 21:00 本地采集的站点物理上限执行，01:30 只能到 50 kW，B 为 121（缺 9），仍 HOLD。\" This is honest.\n\nBut then is the four-slot plan \"可执行\" if physical site limit would clip? It is executable in the sense that A gets its charge; B gets as much as possible. The filing power check passes. The handover flags the discrepancy. Good.\n\nWait, if the plan requests 70 at 01:30 and the physical site limit is 120 with building 70, the station will clip to 50. The R7 bench receipt says actual 70, but that's a different scope. If the actual station is the 21:00 capture station, B gets 121, gap 9, HOLD. Either way B HOLD. A unaffected. The plan is executable for A; B HOLD. So okay.\n\nShould we instead set `acKw` at 01:30 to 50 to avoid requesting beyond physical site limit, while still filing? Then requested [80,40,50,50], B AC=50, B=121 (or 121 with aux?), filing passes (all ≤ limits), but we'd leave 20 kW unused at 01:30 and B even worse. The release-format says \"高效工况下最大可用充电量\" — max available, so request 70. The filing check allows 70. Keep 70.\n\nNow, what does \"dispatchAt85\" mean? It says \"85% 效率下的双车放行决定\" — a boolean indicating whether to dispatch both at 85%. false. Good.\n\nLet's write the files. First revision-receipt.json and release.json with write. Then HANDOVER with write (read already). Ensure JSON valid. Then commit and run depot_release_check on final HEAD. Let's do."}
